WEBVTT

00:00:05.870 --> 00:00:16.610
<i>Along a zigzag the world turns,</i>
<i>I heave out a sigh.</i>

00:00:16.710 --> 00:00:27.620
<i>Someone pauses along the way,</i>
<i>but reality moves on.</i>

00:00:27.860 --> 00:00:33.150
<i>Treat love as love, treat</i>
<i>dreams as dreams.</i>

00:00:33.260 --> 00:00:38.660
<i>It's difficult to say it in earnest.</i>
<i>The times forge ahead, but...</i>

00:00:38.770 --> 00:00:43.570
<i>I want to make you happy...</i>

00:00:43.710 --> 00:00:49.370
<i>I'll do so like I do to</i>
<i>be myself. Yeah!</i>

00:00:49.480 --> 00:00:54.400
<i>I'll make you happy...</i>

00:00:54.520 --> 00:00:59.820
<i>I dedicate all that</i>
<i>I can do to you.</i>

00:00:59.920 --> 00:01:11.130
<i>Along a zigzag the world turns,</i>
<i>I heave out a sigh.</i>

00:01:11.200 --> 00:01:23.380
<i>Someone pauses along the way,</i>
<i>but love doesn't stop for me.</i>

00:01:36.790 --> 00:01:38.380
The devil sayeth...

00:01:38.490 --> 00:01:40.790
"If you are the
Son of God...

00:01:40.900 --> 00:01:43.330
"...turn this rock
into bread."

00:01:44.430 --> 00:01:46.900
Jesus responds...

00:01:47.000 --> 00:01:50.840
"Man does not live
by bread alone."

00:01:56.710 --> 00:02:01.380
This is Timberwolf.
Roger that.

00:02:16.500 --> 00:02:21.370
FILE. 23
A FLOWER 8LOOMS
ON THE VIRGIN ROAD

00:02:22.700 --> 00:02:23.930
Those are pretty!

00:02:24.110 --> 00:02:26.440
They're perfect for
the wedding!

00:02:27.840 --> 00:02:29.310
Hey, Nakajima!

00:02:29.310 --> 00:02:30.040
Yeah?

00:02:30.210 --> 00:02:32.340
We got what
you wanted.

00:02:32.510 --> 00:02:33.550
Here it is.

00:02:33.550 --> 00:02:35.450
Oh, thanks.

00:02:37.390 --> 00:02:43.450
We're more than happy to help since it's
for your father and Sena's wedding!

00:02:43.690 --> 00:02:45.590
Well...

00:02:45.760 --> 00:02:48.720
So, everyone preparing
for tomorrow?

00:02:48.900 --> 00:02:51.520
Well, you shouldn't be doing that
while you're on duty.

00:02:51.700 --> 00:02:54.230
But I'll look the other
way today.

00:02:55.370 --> 00:02:58.100
Chief... Detective
Tokuno...

00:02:58.210 --> 00:02:59.830
You'll be at the wedding
too, right?!

00:03:00.010 --> 00:03:01.080
Well, uh...

00:03:01.080 --> 00:03:02.480
We'll see...

00:03:03.050 --> 00:03:05.380
I'm so envious!

00:03:05.550 --> 00:03:08.210
Isn't it wonderful!
A wedding!

00:03:08.380 --> 00:03:09.750
Mm-hmm!

00:03:09.920 --> 00:03:13.950
I can't believe my old man's
getting married at his age!

00:03:14.420 --> 00:03:17.950
Come on, people can get
married at any age.

00:03:18.530 --> 00:03:22.220
Oh yeah, you're the only one here
who's married, Detective Tokuno.

00:03:22.400 --> 00:03:25.700
Yes. Well, I got married when
I was pretty young.

00:03:25.870 --> 00:03:27.770
How old were you?

00:03:27.770 --> 00:03:28.740
Was it an arranged marriage?

00:03:28.740 --> 00:03:30.240
Tell us all about it!

00:03:30.240 --> 00:03:31.800
Tell us what you were like back then.

00:03:31.970 --> 00:03:36.380
No! He was never
that young!

00:03:36.550 --> 00:03:38.510
Huh?

00:03:40.580 --> 00:03:41.980
At a boutique in the
3rd district...

00:03:42.080 --> 00:03:46.650
...there's a nice dress I checked out that
might be just right for the wedding.

00:03:46.890 --> 00:03:48.580
Oh, really?

00:03:48.760 --> 00:03:50.880
Yoriko! You're on
duty, remember?

00:03:51.060 --> 00:03:52.290
Don't be such a stick-
in-the-mud.

00:03:52.460 --> 00:03:56.990
Yeah, what's the harm? If you wait until
end-of-shift, the store will be closed.

00:03:57.400 --> 00:03:59.260
That's too bad.

00:03:59.430 --> 00:04:02.670
Remember what the Chief said?
He's not going to stop us!

00:04:02.840 --> 00:04:03.860
Geez...

00:04:04.040 --> 00:04:05.400
Okay, we're on
the way.

00:04:05.510 --> 00:04:08.700
Miyuki, make a right
up ahead.

00:04:09.610 --> 00:04:11.580
All right, you win.

00:04:12.980 --> 00:04:13.550
"Police Check"

00:04:13.550 --> 00:04:15.740
The wedding tomorrow
should be fun, huh?

00:04:15.740 --> 00:04:15.750
"Police Check"

00:04:16.120 --> 00:04:18.180
Yeah... I can't wait to meet
the bride's friends...

00:04:18.290 --> 00:04:20.320
...especially since she's just 20.

00:04:20.320 --> 00:04:21.290
You said it.

00:04:24.030 --> 00:04:25.820
What are you going
to wear tomorrow?

00:04:25.930 --> 00:04:27.720
I'm not sure.

00:04:27.830 --> 00:04:31.360
I can't help wishing I was the
one in the wedding dress.

00:04:32.000 --> 00:04:33.400
I know what
you mean.

00:04:33.500 --> 00:04:36.940
Lucky girl!

00:04:38.870 --> 00:04:42.280
Boy, we've been talking about
the wedding all day, huh?

00:04:42.910 --> 00:04:45.510
You're the one who's been
talking the most!

00:04:45.680 --> 00:04:47.940
I can't help but
envy her!

00:04:48.050 --> 00:04:50.920
A wedding is the thing girls
always dream about!

00:04:51.020 --> 00:04:55.150
I sure hope I can have a beautiful
wedding sometime soon!

00:04:55.320 --> 00:04:56.950
So do I!

00:04:57.130 --> 00:04:58.620
In a beautiful white
church...

00:04:58.730 --> 00:05:02.690
...high up on a hill over-
looking the ocean.

00:05:02.960 --> 00:05:04.260
Mm-hmm!

00:05:07.900 --> 00:05:11.460
A beautiful bride in a pure
white flowing gown...

00:05:11.770 --> 00:05:13.710
...walking gently
down the aisle.

00:05:13.810 --> 00:05:18.710
Quietly walking down
the virgin road.

00:05:18.880 --> 00:05:20.850
Ooh, it's so romantic!

00:05:22.250 --> 00:05:24.120
Huh?!

00:05:24.290 --> 00:05:26.150
A... Aoi! You're here!

00:05:26.320 --> 00:05:30.280
Isn't it romantic... a white
wedding dress!

00:05:30.660 --> 00:05:31.750
How envious
I am.

00:05:31.930 --> 00:05:33.220
Umm...

00:06:11.430 --> 00:06:12.930
Can you grab that?

00:06:12.930 --> 00:06:13.740
Sure!

00:06:13.740 --> 00:06:14.640
Ow!

00:06:14.640 --> 00:06:16.330
Careful, Aoi.

00:06:16.510 --> 00:06:17.440
Did it.

00:06:17.440 --> 00:06:18.910
That goes over here.

00:06:18.910 --> 00:06:21.140
What's wrong with this thing?

00:06:21.310 --> 00:06:22.440
Yeah. That's good.

00:06:22.440 --> 00:06:23.340
You okay, Natsumi?

00:06:23.510 --> 00:06:24.670
Yup, fine.

00:06:24.850 --> 00:06:26.280
Got it!

00:06:26.450 --> 00:06:27.540
Welcome back!

00:06:28.580 --> 00:06:30.520
Let's have a
little break.

00:06:31.120 --> 00:06:33.090
I'll grab some glasses
and ice.

00:06:34.260 --> 00:06:35.590
Hey, that reminds me.

00:06:35.690 --> 00:06:39.020
When are Nakajima and Miyuki
getting married?

00:06:39.190 --> 00:06:41.160
Wha?

00:06:45.300 --> 00:06:47.970
I told you not to bring that up!

00:06:47.970 --> 00:06:49.600
Sorry, I forgot.

00:06:50.270 --> 00:06:54.110
It's like this. I'm sure they both know
how they feel about each other.

00:06:54.780 --> 00:06:57.770
But they can't seem
to get anywhere.

00:06:57.950 --> 00:06:59.740
Wow! This looks
delicious!

00:06:59.920 --> 00:07:00.810
Huh?

00:07:00.980 --> 00:07:03.680
Look at all the
stuff here!

00:07:04.390 --> 00:07:05.820
Oh, wow! Look at this!

00:07:05.920 --> 00:07:08.650
Ooh... I love these
chocolate sticks!

00:07:08.820 --> 00:07:11.060
Umm... Those are brown sugar sticks.

00:07:11.060 --> 00:07:12.080
Huh?

00:07:15.160 --> 00:07:18.790
You don't say. Well, I like
brown sugar, too!

00:07:21.500 --> 00:07:22.830
That Ken.

00:07:23.370 --> 00:07:26.070
How long will he make you wait like this?

00:07:26.070 --> 00:07:28.200
Yeah, well...

00:07:28.380 --> 00:07:32.680
He sure is taking a long time
getting the glasses and ice.

00:07:36.250 --> 00:07:39.280
Huh?

00:07:55.170 --> 00:08:06.270
<i>"Kobayakawa."</i>

00:08:06.380 --> 00:08:10.840
<i>"Will you be my..."</i>

00:08:19.960 --> 00:08:20.790
Hmm...

00:08:20.900 --> 00:08:23.460
Nakajima!

00:08:23.630 --> 00:08:26.430
Oh, no!

00:08:26.600 --> 00:08:28.430
Sorry!

00:08:28.600 --> 00:08:30.430
What are you doing, sneaking
up on me like that?!

00:08:30.610 --> 00:08:34.230
I couldn't help myself, seeing you
there drooling over the dress.

00:08:34.410 --> 00:08:36.040
The dress?!

00:08:36.210 --> 00:08:38.580
You were thinking about
Miyuki, weren't you?

00:08:38.750 --> 00:08:39.840
Don't be stupid!

00:08:40.020 --> 00:08:42.680
<i>Hmm. I see. So it's just</i>
<i>a matter of arranging...</i>

00:08:42.780 --> 00:08:44.510
<i>... the right circumstances</i>
<i>for Miyuki and Ken.</i>

00:08:45.650 --> 00:08:48.890
I wasn't looking at the
dress. I wasn't.

00:08:49.660 --> 00:08:52.560
Hurry up and get back
here, you guys.

00:08:59.630 --> 00:09:01.600
Huh?

00:09:21.160 --> 00:09:22.780
The finishing touch...

00:09:23.460 --> 00:09:24.990
We're all ready!

00:09:24.990 --> 00:09:26.860
We're all ready!
Yeah! All right!

00:09:27.630 --> 00:09:30.290
Thanks everybody! You've
done a great job!

00:09:31.100 --> 00:09:33.030
Look at you!

00:09:33.030 --> 00:09:34.470
You're so handsome!

00:09:34.470 --> 00:09:36.730
Think so?

00:09:36.910 --> 00:09:40.900
Quit fooling around, Dad. How
about helping out a little?

00:09:41.080 --> 00:09:44.140
You're talking to the groom,
remember? Stupid!

00:09:44.310 --> 00:09:45.110
Huh?

00:09:45.110 --> 00:09:46.110
How's that feel?

00:09:46.110 --> 00:09:47.350
Cut it out!

00:09:47.350 --> 00:09:49.010
Hey, has anybody seen Sena?

00:09:49.180 --> 00:09:51.050
She's over there getting ready.

00:09:51.050 --> 00:09:52.520
Stop it, Dad!

00:09:52.690 --> 00:09:56.990
No, Dad!
Cut it out!

00:09:57.160 --> 00:09:58.750
Huh?

00:10:08.200 --> 00:10:09.570
What's going on?

00:10:09.740 --> 00:10:11.710
I'm scared, Natsumi.

00:10:11.870 --> 00:10:12.970
I'll take care of them.

00:10:13.140 --> 00:10:14.630
Great! They're here!

00:10:14.810 --> 00:10:15.330
Eh?

00:10:16.110 --> 00:10:17.840
I thought they were
all Ducatis.

00:10:18.810 --> 00:10:20.010
There's a Kajiba...

00:10:20.120 --> 00:10:21.580
...a Moto Guzzi...

00:10:21.750 --> 00:10:23.910
...a B-Motor SB6...

00:10:24.020 --> 00:10:25.950
...and even a Zirella!

00:10:26.120 --> 00:10:27.550
And every single
one of them...

00:10:27.660 --> 00:10:29.590
...has been customized!

00:10:29.760 --> 00:10:31.060
Unreal!

00:10:31.590 --> 00:10:33.560
Is that right?

00:10:33.900 --> 00:10:36.090
It's more than unreal.

00:10:36.200 --> 00:10:38.790
It's a biker's buffet!

00:10:40.640 --> 00:10:41.830
Miyuki! Be careful!

00:10:43.170 --> 00:10:45.440
My little lost flock...

00:10:45.540 --> 00:10:48.840
Dost thou love
thy neighbor?

00:11:03.760 --> 00:11:05.520
My priest! I'm so glad
you could make it!

00:11:05.690 --> 00:11:06.520
"Priest?!"

00:11:06.690 --> 00:11:09.060
Yessiree. A regular
church priest.

00:11:09.230 --> 00:11:10.320
No way!

00:11:10.500 --> 00:11:13.430
Lots of your old buddies
are here, too!

00:11:13.600 --> 00:11:15.230
Yaobatsu?
Is it you?

00:11:15.400 --> 00:11:18.200
Daimaru! I came to check
out your new wife!

00:11:18.910 --> 00:11:20.640
Dennis! How've
you been?

00:11:20.810 --> 00:11:22.470
Let's go wild!

00:11:23.650 --> 00:11:27.710
Ogin? It's been
a long time.

00:11:27.880 --> 00:11:28.710
Wow!

00:11:29.420 --> 00:11:31.610
Everybody's so cool! They're
my kinda people!

00:11:31.790 --> 00:11:33.410
Have fun shopping,
Natsumi.

00:11:33.990 --> 00:11:37.290
These are all
my friends!

00:11:37.390 --> 00:11:39.290
Huh?

00:11:40.130 --> 00:11:43.390
Excuse me! Is this where Sena's
having her wedding?

00:11:43.800 --> 00:11:44.790
Yeah!

00:11:44.970 --> 00:11:47.230
Those must be all
of Sena's friends.

00:11:47.400 --> 00:11:49.500
Miyuki's turn to
drool now.

00:11:49.670 --> 00:11:50.830
Unreal!

00:12:04.850 --> 00:12:07.220
Oh wow...

00:12:07.390 --> 00:12:09.650
Miyuki! Don't space
out on us!

00:12:11.330 --> 00:12:13.730
Our Lord has
brought...

00:12:13.830 --> 00:12:16.630
...his little flock together on
this happy occasion...

00:12:17.470 --> 00:12:22.600
...to celebrate the marriage
of Daimaru and Sena.

00:12:22.840 --> 00:12:24.570
So let's get
busy!

00:12:24.840 --> 00:12:28.100
Woo-hoo!

00:12:28.810 --> 00:12:32.750
But there's something we
must do before that!

00:12:33.210 --> 00:12:35.210
Hey, are you sure
about this?

00:12:35.380 --> 00:12:36.940
Of course!

00:12:37.050 --> 00:12:39.140
We haven't done
this in decades!

00:12:39.250 --> 00:12:41.720
We'll go back
in time...

00:12:41.820 --> 00:12:46.560
...to when we were young
and passionate...

00:12:47.130 --> 00:12:49.530
...for the main event
of today's wedding.

00:12:50.270 --> 00:12:54.200
The Time Trials!

00:12:54.300 --> 00:12:56.000
The winner will
receive...

00:12:56.100 --> 00:12:59.540
...a sweet kiss from
the lovely bride!

00:12:59.710 --> 00:13:00.670
Let's go!

00:13:00.780 --> 00:13:02.400
Yeah! That's what
we came for!

00:13:02.580 --> 00:13:04.640
It's time to show
off my stuff!

00:13:04.810 --> 00:13:06.280
You said it!

00:13:06.280 --> 00:13:08.040
Hang on there!

00:13:08.220 --> 00:13:09.340
Pardon?

00:13:09.520 --> 00:13:11.280
If the prize is a kiss
from the bride...

00:13:11.390 --> 00:13:13.850
...then what's the point of the
women entering the contest?

00:13:14.020 --> 00:13:16.080
Yeah, that's right! What kind
of prize is that for us?!

00:13:16.260 --> 00:13:19.280
Calm down, ladies. I have a solution.
If a woman wins the contest...

00:13:20.230 --> 00:13:22.720
Then the prize will
be...

00:13:22.830 --> 00:13:24.160
...a nice hot kiss from
yours truly!

00:13:24.330 --> 00:13:26.860
Pass!

00:13:27.040 --> 00:13:27.970
No good?

00:13:28.140 --> 00:13:29.970
There he goes again.

00:13:30.140 --> 00:13:31.800
Ladies and gentlemen!

00:13:31.970 --> 00:13:34.100
The main event is
about to begin!

00:13:34.280 --> 00:13:35.710
You can't have
a race!

00:13:35.880 --> 00:13:36.540
Huh?

00:13:36.710 --> 00:13:37.910
We're definitely not going
to stand here...

00:13:38.010 --> 00:13:40.950
...and watch you
have a time trial.

00:13:41.120 --> 00:13:43.170
Maybe we could just
cover our eyes...

00:13:43.280 --> 00:13:44.840
...while they
do it.

00:13:45.020 --> 00:13:47.280
You know that's not
what I mean.

00:13:47.820 --> 00:13:49.760
Excuse me, ladies.

00:13:49.860 --> 00:13:53.120
We've been holding this
contest since long...

00:13:53.230 --> 00:13:55.200
...long before you
were even born.

00:13:55.300 --> 00:13:56.920
You're going to need
to come up with...

00:13:57.030 --> 00:13:59.970
...a pretty good reason
for us to not have it.

00:14:00.770 --> 00:14:03.070
Well? What do you have
to say for yourselves?

00:14:04.840 --> 00:14:07.100
We're cops.

00:14:07.280 --> 00:14:08.830
That's good enough
for me.

00:14:08.940 --> 00:14:10.070
Ladies and gentlemen!

00:14:10.180 --> 00:14:12.040
Well then, there shall be a change
in the main event...

00:14:12.150 --> 00:14:15.780
...but the prize is still a kiss from the bride.
Today's event will now be a Slow Race!

00:14:15.950 --> 00:14:17.040
Yeah!

00:14:17.220 --> 00:14:21.050
I guess that'll
be all right.

00:14:22.220 --> 00:14:23.050
Nakajima!

00:14:23.220 --> 00:14:24.280
Um...

00:14:24.460 --> 00:14:26.360
You're going to be
in the race, too?

00:14:26.530 --> 00:14:28.720
Uh, yeah. Dad
asked me to.

00:14:28.900 --> 00:14:29.920
<i>"P... Please, son!"</i>

00:14:30.030 --> 00:14:32.660
<i>"I can't be a part of it, seeing</i>
<i>as I'm the groom!"</i>

00:14:32.770 --> 00:14:35.500
<i>"I'd rather you were the</i>
<i>one to kiss Sena...</i>

00:14:35.600 --> 00:14:37.000
<i>"...than one of the</i>
<i>other guys!"</i>

00:14:37.910 --> 00:14:39.900
And that's how I
ended up here.

00:14:40.070 --> 00:14:41.270
Oh?

00:14:41.440 --> 00:14:44.100
Really! I didn't want
to be in the race!

00:14:44.210 --> 00:14:46.310
It's just that my father
made me promise!

00:14:48.320 --> 00:14:51.340
I don't care about
this race!

00:14:51.450 --> 00:14:54.320
It's just my father...
my damn father!

00:14:54.490 --> 00:14:56.920
Forget it. You don't
have to apologize.

00:14:57.090 --> 00:14:59.060
But I wasn't...

00:15:01.660 --> 00:15:02.630
Uh...

00:15:04.200 --> 00:15:05.670
Ready?

00:15:05.770 --> 00:15:06.830
Go!

00:15:06.970 --> 00:15:11.870
Come on! You
can do it!

00:15:13.270 --> 00:15:16.070
I can handle
a slow race.

00:15:16.980 --> 00:15:20.070
It's all in how you use
your handlebars.

00:15:20.680 --> 00:15:23.410
Come on, Nakajima!

00:15:23.580 --> 00:15:24.950
You can do it!

00:15:25.120 --> 00:15:27.250
Uh... oops.

00:15:27.420 --> 00:15:29.650
That's okay,
I don't care.

00:15:29.760 --> 00:15:32.230
He won't lose,
anyway.

00:15:32.390 --> 00:15:33.660
Oh?

00:15:33.830 --> 00:15:35.350
He's doing this
for his dad.

00:15:38.300 --> 00:15:40.200
Uh...

00:15:40.370 --> 00:15:43.300
<i>Kobayakawa's got</i>
<i>to be furious.</i>

00:15:43.940 --> 00:15:45.800
<i>Maybe I should</i>
<i>try to lose...</i>

00:15:45.910 --> 00:15:49.100
<i>... no matter what</i>
<i>Dad said.</i>

00:16:10.430 --> 00:16:12.330
I can't take it!

00:16:12.870 --> 00:16:14.960
Hey! Dennis dropped out!

00:16:15.600 --> 00:16:18.230
Oh, no! I stalled.

00:16:18.410 --> 00:16:20.340
Yaobatsu is out
of the race!

00:16:20.510 --> 00:16:22.640
Whoa!

00:16:23.310 --> 00:16:24.800
Damn!

00:16:24.980 --> 00:16:26.640
They're all out!

00:16:26.750 --> 00:16:28.910
Come on, keep going!

00:16:29.220 --> 00:16:30.420
Oh, crap!

00:16:30.420 --> 00:16:31.890
Oh, crap!
Kishuya, you're out!

00:16:31.890 --> 00:16:32.020
Kishuya, you're out!

00:16:32.020 --> 00:16:32.790
Darn!

00:16:32.790 --> 00:16:34.560
That's it for you, Gan.

00:16:34.560 --> 00:16:35.420
Dammit!

00:16:35.420 --> 00:16:37.390
Oops! Looks like you're out, too!

00:16:37.560 --> 00:16:38.990
<i>Oh, no!</i>

00:16:39.530 --> 00:16:44.020
<i>It's just the</i>
<i>two of us!</i>

00:16:44.570 --> 00:16:47.470
Like father, like son!

00:16:47.700 --> 00:16:49.430
You're holding up well.

00:16:49.870 --> 00:16:50.630
<i>Damn!</i>

00:16:50.740 --> 00:16:52.400
<i>I won't give up now!</i>

00:16:52.510 --> 00:16:55.000
<i>I can't lose to a forward-</i>
<i>control Harley!</i>

00:16:55.110 --> 00:16:57.630
<i>I have to uphold my reputation as</i>
<i>a motorcycle cop at Bokuto.</i>

00:16:57.810 --> 00:16:59.780
Huh?

00:16:59.950 --> 00:17:02.710
Damn! I'm out of gas!

00:17:05.620 --> 00:17:08.180
Huh?!

00:17:08.490 --> 00:17:11.150
And the winner is...
Ken Nakajima!

00:17:11.330 --> 00:17:14.320
Way to go, son!

00:17:14.500 --> 00:17:16.660
Thank you. Thank
you very much.

00:17:20.130 --> 00:17:22.030
Miyuki! Miyuki!

00:17:22.200 --> 00:17:23.430
Huh?

00:17:23.600 --> 00:17:25.570
Come here
a minute.

00:17:27.840 --> 00:17:29.570
Huh?

00:17:30.310 --> 00:17:32.680
And now, the moment you've
all been waiting for!

00:17:32.780 --> 00:17:34.210
The winner of the
Slow Race...

00:17:34.320 --> 00:17:38.550
...Ken Nakajima, will receive a hot
kiss from the lovely bride!

00:17:40.990 --> 00:17:46.590
Ladies and gentlemen, may
I present the bride!

00:17:46.760 --> 00:17:48.730
Wow!

00:18:03.850 --> 00:18:05.640
Plant a big one on
her, Nakajima.

00:18:05.810 --> 00:18:08.300
Yes, ma'am.

00:18:11.490 --> 00:18:13.010
Uh... um...

00:18:13.120 --> 00:18:16.280
Maybe we should just
pretend to kiss?

00:18:27.300 --> 00:18:28.700
Huh?

00:18:28.870 --> 00:18:31.200
Congratulations,
Nakajima!

00:18:31.370 --> 00:18:33.840
Uh...

00:19:13.550 --> 00:19:20.040
<i>Since I was a kid I've been</i>
<i>covered in oil...</i>

00:19:21.290 --> 00:19:27.660
<i>Riding down the</i>
<i>old, dirty road...</i>

00:19:28.860 --> 00:19:35.130
<i>That's the kinda guy I am but</i>
<i>tonight I'll make it right...</i>

00:19:36.240 --> 00:19:42.730
<i>I'm sayin'goodbye to Ioneliness.</i>

00:19:44.050 --> 00:19:47.980
<i>The cathedral shining under</i>
<i>the crescent moon.</i>

00:19:48.120 --> 00:19:51.520
<i>My heart is on fire...</i>

00:19:51.890 --> 00:20:00.760
<i>Down the white road that lies ahead...</i>
<i>She and I will be side by side.</i>

00:20:01.530 --> 00:20:19.610
<i>The flower blossoms</i>
<i>on the virgin road.</i>

00:20:19.750 --> 00:20:22.880
<i>Yeah!</i>

00:20:23.550 --> 00:20:27.320
Get ready, all you eligible ladies! The bride
is about to throw her bouquet.

00:20:27.420 --> 00:20:28.820
Who will be the
lucky lady...

00:20:28.920 --> 00:20:32.050
...to catch the
bouquet?

00:20:32.460 --> 00:20:33.290
Yippee!

00:20:33.460 --> 00:20:35.490
Over here!
Over here!

00:20:35.660 --> 00:20:38.460
I might as well
give it a shot!

00:20:38.570 --> 00:20:40.330
Okay, we're ready
for you!

00:20:40.500 --> 00:20:43.990
Okay, here goes!

00:20:44.770 --> 00:20:47.570
Huh?

00:20:54.720 --> 00:20:57.510
<i>Strange...</i>

00:21:02.090 --> 00:21:03.610
Lucky me!

00:21:03.790 --> 00:21:08.590
What's the point of
you catching it?!

00:21:16.500 --> 00:21:17.800
Bye everybody!

00:21:17.970 --> 00:21:19.270
Adios!

00:21:19.440 --> 00:21:21.740
Congratulations!
Take care!

00:21:22.540 --> 00:21:24.270
Bye-bye!

00:21:25.380 --> 00:21:28.110
Take care!

00:21:28.220 --> 00:21:32.050
Good luck!

00:21:32.220 --> 00:21:35.250
Don't forget to write!

00:22:02.880 --> 00:22:11.460
<i>I live my life my own way, doing</i>
<i>things others wouldn't.</i>

00:22:11.730 --> 00:22:20.030
<i>Being strong isn't enough.</i>
<i>It makes me Ionely.</i>

00:22:25.740 --> 00:22:31.040
<i>I can feel your presence</i>
<i>as if you're right here...</i>

00:22:31.610 --> 00:22:39.150
<i>... but I can't say a word.</i>

00:22:40.650 --> 00:22:47.920
<i>The feelings I hide within might</i>
<i>break into pieces...</i>

00:22:49.460 --> 00:22:56.840
<i>But if I don't say anything,</i>
<i>nothing can begin.</i>

00:22:57.170 --> 00:23:04.400
<i>The wind gently blows...</i>
<i>Time flows...</i>

00:23:04.580 --> 00:23:14.080
<i>Time flows... And soon</i>
<i>I can be honest...</i>

00:23:14.260 --> 00:23:17.220
<i>Thank you,</i>
<i>friend!</i>

00:23:23.400 --> 00:23:25.230
"A Lady and a Gentleman"

00:23:25.400 --> 00:23:26.400
"Traffic Safety"
"Let's obey traffic laws!"

00:23:26.400 --> 00:23:29.770
One day, at Bokuto Station,
a man appeared to Aoi.

00:23:29.940 --> 00:23:31.300
He is cool, handsome,
and debonair...

00:23:31.410 --> 00:23:33.570
...and for some reason,
he wears a white rose.

00:23:33.740 --> 00:23:36.640
What's he up to? What's
with the white rose?

00:23:36.810 --> 00:23:39.210
Then, their secret past
will be revealed.

00:23:39.380 --> 00:23:41.810
Umm... What's everybody
talking about?

00:23:41.980 --> 00:23:44.040
The cast is all
assembled!

00:23:44.220 --> 00:23:46.190
Next time, You're Under
Arrest, File 24...

00:23:46.290 --> 00:23:47.720
..."A White Rose For Aoi."

00:23:47.860 --> 00:23:49.860
Every beautiful rose
has its thorn.
